{"unit_id":"AngelosZou__dsh-multi-folder#card-zh","repo":"AngelosZou/dsh-multi-folder","commit":"445a803cdfdb917ab6d46b09aaf700be36bbf186","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-folder 是面向 DSH Web 的多工作目录插件。它在会话页提供目录管理面板和 /multi-folder 命令，并可在新建会话时通过无 session API 配置项目目录。主工作目录保持不变；插件将已配置目录接入工具执行策略、系统提示和 @ 文件发现。用户可以添加、移除或替换目录，浏览目录并在宿主文件管理器中打开。适合需要在一个 DSH 项目中同时处理多个代码或文档目录的用户；无需 API 密钥，配置保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1375-1400","lib/index.js:1646-1726","lib/client.js:1428-1480","lib/client.js:1561-1620"]}
{"unit_id":"AngelosZou__dsh-multi-folder#card-en","repo":"AngelosZou/dsh-multi-folder","commit":"445a803cdfdb917ab6d46b09aaf700be36bbf186","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-multi-folder lets DSH web users manage secondary project directories from a panel or /multi-folder command. A sessionless API supports setup before a session starts. Configured directories work with host tools and @ file discovery. Settings are local; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1375-1400","lib/index.js:1646-1726","lib/client.js:1428-1480","lib/client.js:1561-1620"]}
